Jo Hai Waqar Mutlabi Khandan Ka.<br>
Tum Ko Suna Raha Hoon Rajaz Oss Jawan Ka.<br>
<br>
1- Qasim Hoon Karwan-e-Shujat Ka Mir Hoon.<br>
Dono Jahan Mein Aap Hi Apni Nazeer Hoon.<br>
Har Khaibari Mahaz Ka Main Qalageer Hoon.<br>
Talwar Ka Dhani Hoon Qalam Ka Ameer Hoon.<br>
Seene Mein Dil Hai Fatah-e-Badar-o-Hunain Ka.<br>
Beta Hasan Ka Hoon Tu Sipahi Hussain Ka.<br>
<br>
2- Zahra-o-Mustafa-o-Ali-o-Hasan Hussain.<br>
Sajjad Our Baqir-o-Jafar Dilon Ke Chain.<br>
Kazim Raza Taqi-o-Naqi Haq Ki Zaib-o-Zain.<br>
Our Askari-o-Mehdi-e-Dein Jan-e-Mashreqain.<br>
Awwal Se Taba Sakin-e-Khizra Ka Aaina.<br>
Hum Terhwin Baras Mein Hain Chodah Ka Aaina.<br>
<br>
3- Sar Par Hai Khood-e-Nad-e-Ali Fatha Ki Kaleed.<br>
Pehne Hoye Hain Jism Pe Hum Zirrah-e-Al-Hadeed.<br>
Kartay Hain Ran Mein Waqt-e-Waga Hamla-e-Shadeed.<br>
Woh Taig Hain Keh Jis Ka Niwala Hai Har Yazid.<br>
Patka Kamar Mein Hai Shah-e-Aali Sifaat Ka.<br>
Taweez Bazoon Pe Hai Baba Ke Hath Ka.<br>
<br>
4- Yaad-e-Shahadat-e-Shuhda Hai Hamarey Sath.<br>
Farzand-e-Fatima Ki Wila Hai Hamarey Sath.<br>
Ik Gham Naseeb Maa Ki Dua Hai Hamarey Sath.<br>
Hum Hain Khuda Ke Sath Khuda Hai Hamarey Sath.<br>
Haq Ke Khilaf Kufar Ki Zoor Aazmai Hai.<br>
Hum Se Lara Jo Oss Ki Khuda Se Larai Hai.<br>
<br>
5- Yakja Yahan Pe Kis Ke Saharey Hoye Ho Tum.<br>
Kya Soch Kar Wiga Ke Shararey Hoye Ho Tum.<br>
Bazm-e-Hudaibiya Mein Bhi Harey Hoye Ho Tum.<br>
Baba Hasan Ki Sulha Ke Marey Hoye Ho Tum.<br>
Mosa Hain Sahiron Ke Tamashon Se Kya Larein.<br>
Hum Malik-e-Hayat Hain Lashon Se Kya Larein.<br>
<br>
6- Anjam-e-Karzar Pe Koi Nazar Bhi Hai.<br>
Kya Sham Ke Risalon Mein Harf-e-Sahar Bhi Hai.<br>
Seene Akar Ke Taan Rahe Ho Jigar Bhi Hai.<br>
Larney Tu Aa Gaye Ho Tumhein Kuch Khabar Bhi Hai.<br>
Iss Rukh Se Bhi Shikast-e-Sitam Aashkar Hai.<br>
Oss Jang Mein Qalam Tha Yahan Zulfiqar Hai.<br>
<br>
7- Kufar-o-Nifaq-o-Shirk Ke Paidaishi Ghulam.<br>
Bad Shakal-o-Bad Naseeb-o-Bad Adwar-o-Kaj Khiram.<br>
Bad Nasal-o-Bad Tamasho Bad Anjam-o-Bad Kalam.<br>
Soraj Se Larney Aaye Hain Shab Zadgan-e-Sham.<br>
Gham Ko Khushi Samajh Ke Uchalna Tu Dekhiye.<br>
Chamgadiron Ka Din Mein Nikalna Tu Dekhiye.<br>
<br>
8- Jagay Ho Shab Ko Dar Se Keh Soye Ho Shamiyon.<br>
Aankhein Tu Keh Rahi Hain Keh Roye Ho Shamiyon.<br>
Buzdil Safon Ko Saf Mein Paroye Ho Shamiyon.<br>
Ab Tak Ghuma Ke Dasht Mein Khoye Ho Shamiyon.<br>
Kya Bhool Ho Gayi Hai Yeh Samjho Gay Dair Se.<br>
Jangal Mein Larney Aaye Ho Our Woh Bhi Shair Se.<br>
<br>
9- Foaj-e-Kaseer Dekh Ke Itra Rahe Ho Tum.<br>
Hinda Ki Le Mein Badar-o-Ohad Ga Rahe Ho Tum.<br>
Bugz-e-Abu Turab Mein Bal Kha Rahe Ho Tum.<br>
Khamosh Hain Tu Munh Pe Charhey Aa Rahe Ho Tum.<br>
Tukron Mein Bant Dein Gay Labon Ki Kaman Ko.<br>
Guddi Se Khainch Lein Gay Tumhari Zaban Ko.